<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16955" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτάομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱτ]</span>, 
			Pass.
		, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffer, be in distress,</i> in Trag. always in
				pres.
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτώμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					384
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				17
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				182
			</span></i>, exc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτώμεσθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					269
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτασθῶσιν</span> is dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Cat.Oxy.</u>
				1358
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as law-term,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ τις ἀταθείη</span> the
				<i>injured party,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Leg.Gort.
				4.29
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀταμένος</span> the
				<i>loser</i> in a suit, ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϝατᾶται</span>”
				<i>suffers a penalty,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					5(1).1155
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Gythium</span>):—
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτάω,</span>
			aor.
			subj.
			3sg.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτάσῃ</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				6.23
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>.</div>
